<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Larkspur Hosting: Friendly Web Hosting for Small Sites</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Larkspur Hosting offers simple, affordable web hosting with real humans on the support line.">
  <style>
    :root {
      --ink: #1f2933;
      --muted: #5b6770;
      --paper: #fbfaf7;
      --accent: #2f6f4f;
      --accent-dark: #245a3f;
      --card: #ffffff;
      --line: #e4e1d8;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    body {
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
      color: var(--ink);
      background: var(--paper);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    a { color: var(--accent); }

    .wrap {
      max-width: 1080px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 24px;
    }

    header {
      padding: 20px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: var(--paper);
    }

    .nav {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .logo {
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      color: var(--ink);
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 24px;
      list-style: none;
    }

    .nav-links a {
      color: var(--ink);
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--accent); }

    .hero {
      padding: 96px 0 72px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.4rem);
      line-height: 1.15;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .hero p {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      max-width: 620px;
      margin: 0 auto 36px;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 14px 28px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin: 6px;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: var(--accent);
      color: #fff;
    }

    .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--accent-dark); }

    .btn-secondary {
      border: 1px solid var(--accent);
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    .btn-secondary:hover { background: #eef5f1; }

    .features {
      padding: 72px 0;
    }

    .features h2,
    .plans h2,
    .faq h2 {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 48px;
    }

    .grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .card {
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 28px;
    }

    .card h3 {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .card p {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.97rem;
    }

    .plans {
      padding: 72px 0;
      background: #f2f0ea;
    }

    .plan {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .plan .price {
      font-size: 2.2rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin: 12px 0 4px;
    }

    .plan .price span {
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-weight: 400;
    }

    .plan ul {
      list-style: none;
      margin: 18px 0 24px;
      color: var(--muted);
      flex-grow: 1;
    }

    .plan li {
      padding: 6px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--line);
    }

    .plan .btn {
      text-align: center;
    }

    .plan.featured {
      border: 2px solid var(--accent);
    }

    .tag {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--accent);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }

    .faq {
      padding: 72px 0;
    }

    .faq-item {
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding: 24px 0;
      max-width: 760px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .faq-item h3 {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .faq-item p {
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .cta {
      padding: 80px 0;
      text-align: center;
      background: var(--accent);
      color: #fff;
    }

    .cta h2 {
      font-size: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .cta p {
      opacity: 0.9;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }

    .cta .btn-primary {
      background: #fff;
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    .cta .btn-primary:hover {
      background: #eef5f1;
    }

    footer {
      padding: 40px 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      text-align: center;
    }

    footer a {
      color: var(--muted);
      margin: 0 10px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .hero { padding: 64px 0 48px; }
      .nav-links { gap: 16px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header>
    <div class="wrap nav">
      <a href="#" class="logo">Larkspur Hosting</a>
      <ul class="nav-links">
        <li><a href="#features">Features</a></li>
        <li><a href="#plans">Plans</a></li>
        <li><a href="#faq">FAQ</a></li>
        <li><a href="#support">Support</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h1>Web hosting for small sites<br>and the people who run them.</h1>
        <p>Fast servers, free migrations, and a support team that answers the phone. Put your site online this afternoon and get back to the work you actually care about.</p>
        <a href="#plans" class="btn btn-primary">See plans</a>
        <a href="#features" class="btn btn-secondary">What you get</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="features" id="features">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>Everything a small site needs</h2>
        <div class="grid">
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Free SSL certificates</h3>
            <p>Every site gets HTTPS automatically, renewed without any action from you.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>One-click installs</h3>
            <p>WordPress, Ghost, and other popular tools install in under a minute from your control panel.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Daily backups</h3>
            <p>We keep 30 days of nightly backups, and restoring one takes a single click.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Solar-powered data center</h3>
            <p>Our main facility runs on renewable energy, and we publish the numbers every year.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Free site migration</h3>
            <p>Moving from another host? We will move your files, databases, and email for free.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Human support</h3>
            <p>Reach a real person by phone, chat, or email. Most questions get answered in under 15 minutes.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="plans" id="plans">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>Simple pricing, no surprises</h2>
        <div class="grid">
          <div class="card plan">
            <h3>Starter</h3>
            <div class="price">$4<span>/mo</span></div>
            <p>For a single personal site or blog.</p>
            <ul>
              <li>1 website</li>
              <li>10 GB storage</li>
              <li>Free SSL</li>
              <li>Daily backups</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="#" class="btn btn-secondary">Choose Starter</a>
          </div>
          <div class="card plan featured">
            <span class="tag">Most popular</span>
            <h3>Growth</h3>
            <div class="price">$9<span>/mo</span></div>
            <p>For small businesses and busy portfolios.</p>
            <ul>
              <li>5 websites</li>
              <li>50 GB storage</li>
              <li>Free SSL</li>
              <li>Daily backups</li>
              <li>Staging environment</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary">Choose Growth</a>
          </div>
          <div class="card plan">
            <h3>Studio</h3>
            <div class="price">$19<span>/mo</span></div>
            <p>For agencies and sites with real traffic.</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Unlimited websites</li>
              <li>200 GB storage</li>
              <li>Free SSL</li>
              <li>Hourly backups</li>
              <li>Priority phone support</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="#" class="btn btn-secondary">Choose Studio</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="faq" id="faq">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>Questions people ask us</h2>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>Can I cancel at any time?</h3>
          <p>Yes. Cancel from your dashboard and you will not be charged again. We refund unused time in the first 30 days, no questions asked.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>Do you offer a free trial?</h3>
          <p>Every new account gets a 30-day money-back guarantee, so you can test your site on our servers risk free.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>What happens if my site goes down?</h3>
          <p>We monitor every server around the clock. If something breaks, our on-call team gets an alert and starts working on it right away. We also credit your account for any downtime beyond our 99.9% uptime target.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>Can you help me move my site?</h3>
          <p>Yes. Send us your login details from your old host and we will handle the move, usually within one business day.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta" id="support">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>Ready when you are.</h2>
        <p>Start a plan today or call us with any question. We are happy to talk before you sign up.</p>
        <a href="#plans" class="btn btn-primary">Get started</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="wrap">
      <p>&copy; 2026 Larkspur Hosting. Small servers, friendly people.</p>
      <p style="margin-top: 12px;">
        <a href="#">Status</a>
        <a href="#">Privacy</a>
        <a href="#">Terms</a>
        <a href="#">Contact</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
```

