# iso8601-duration

A small, dependency-free library for parsing and formatting ISO 8601 durations such as `P1Y2M3DT4H5M6S`, `PT0.5S`, and `P2W`.

ISO 8601 durations describe a span of time in calendar units rather than an exact number of seconds, so `P1M` has no fixed length until it is anchored to a date. This library keeps that distinction: it parses durations into structured components, converts them to exact seconds when the unit lengths are fixed, and resolves calendar-based durations against a reference date.

```js
import { parse, toSeconds, addTo } from "iso8601-duration";

parse("P1Y2M3DT4H5M6S");
// { years: 1, months: 2, days: 3, hours: 4, minutes: 5, seconds: 6 }

toSeconds("PT1H30M");
// 5400

addTo(new Date("2026-01-31T00:00:00Z"), "P1M");
// 2026-02-28T00:00:00.000Z
```

